System Reference Document 5.1
-----------------------------
This work includes material taken from the System Reference Document 5.1
("SRD 5.1") by Wizards of the Coast LLC and available at
https://dnd.wizards.com/resources/systems-reference-document. The SRD 5.1 is
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
available at https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode.
The SRD 5.1 material was taken from the Foundry VTT dnd5e system's data
(https://github.com/foundryvtt/dnd5e).

Icons
-----
Token silhouettes from game-icons.net (https://game-icons.net):
"Dragon head", "Sea dragon", "Wyvern" and "Dragon spiral" by Lorc
(https://lorcblog.blogspot.com) and "Spiked dragon head" by Delapouite
(https://delapouite.com), licensed under CC BY 3.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/). Recoloured and framed.

